---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | GRICH" description="Terms of Service for using the GRICH Global Regulatory Intelligence System.">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-slate-300 py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
      
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-semibold">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing and using the Global Regulatory Intelligence & Compliance Hub (GRICH), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-semibold">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>GRICH provides automated legal intelligence and compliance monitoring services for e-commerce sellers. Our "Reports" are generated based on public court data.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-semibold">3. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>The information provided by GRICH is for informational purposes only and does not constitute legal advice. We are not a law firm.</p>
      </section>
      
      <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-800">
        <a href="/" class="text-red-500 hover:text-red-400">← Back to Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
